[TITLE]
A bad value and an unknown keyword
[JUNCTIONS]
 J1  10  5
 J2  10  5
[RESERVOIRS]
 R1  100
[TANKS]
 T1  50  5  1  10  20
[PIPES]
 P1  R1  J1  1000  12  100
 P2  J1  J2  1000  12  100
 P3  J2  T1  1000  12  100  0  CV
[VALVES]
 V1  J1  T1  12  GPV  C1
[CURVES]
 C1  0  0
 C1  100  10
[RULES]
RULE Good
IF NODE J1 PRESSURE > 10
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS CLOSED
ELSE PIPE P2 STATUS IS OPEN
PRIORITY 2

RULE Bad
IF NODE J1 PRESSURE > ten
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS CLOSED

RULE Later
IF SYSTEM TIME > 2
THEN PIPE P2 STATUS IS OPEN
[END]
